# ---- added after the first images ---------------------------------------------------
# Everything from here on is ALSO carried by an update bundle (with what it
# needs) and installed by it, so a machine installed before a package was added
# gets it too; "Update the system" (online) installs it as well. Keep this
# heading line as it is: make-update.sh and the build find the list by it.
#
# Sound: ALSA's tools (the volume in the quick settings; alsa-restore keeps it
# across restarts), its mixer profiles, and the firmware the sound of most
# Intel laptops and tablets since about 2020 needs (Sound Open Firmware).
